UnitCLPool::GetSecondsPerStakedLiquidityCumulativeX128
├── when stakedLiquidity is eq to zero
│   └── it should return the stored cumulative unchanged
└── when stakedLiquidity is gt zero
    ├── when no time has elapsed since lastUpdated
    │   └── it should return the stored cumulative unchanged
    └── when time has elapsed since lastUpdated
        ├── it should return the stored cumulative plus elapsed over staked
        └── when given a concrete stored cumulative and staked liquidity
            └── it should return the stored cumulative plus the rounded elapsed over staked
